</section>

<section #l1-lang | `<lang>`>

<sub-section | Specification>

`category` `metadata` · Layer 1 `<lang>` · JATS `<(no direct element; maps to xml:lang attribute)>` · `content` `prose` → `<children>`

*No kwargs or boolean flags.*

Produced by: canonical `<lang>`.

<sub-section | Examples>

<code #code:l1-lang-1>
