*Structural / front-matter — shown as source. It carries metadata or apparatus (configuration, stored data, document front matter), not standalone body content, so there is no in-flow live box.*

*ISO 8601 publication date — the preferred form.*

<code #code:l1-publication-date-2>
<meta>
  <publication-date | March 15, 2024>
</meta>
</code>

*Structural / front-matter — shown as source. It carries metadata or apparatus (configuration, stored data, document front matter), not standalone body content, so there is no in-flow live box.*

*Free-form publication date. Acceptable but ISO 8601 is preferred for predictable JATS export and machine readability.*

</section>

